docs {
  Koleksi kuliner/tempat makan (48-api-culinary.md).
  Publik: GET /api/v1/culinary/cuisines (list published), GET /api/v1/culinary/cuisines/:slug,
  GET /api/v1/culinary/places, GET /api/v1/culinary/places/:slug,
  GET /api/v1/culinary/categories.
  Usulan: POST /api/v1/culinary/contributions (boleh anonim, 5/jam per IP),
  POST /api/v1/culinary/contributions/change (perbaikan, field-lock),
  mine/cancel/resubmit.
  Klaim: POST /api/v1/culinary/places/:slug/claims (wajib login).
  Laporan: POST /api/v1/culinary/cuisines/:slug/reports dan
  POST /api/v1/culinary/places/:slug/reports.
  Admin: /api/v1/admin/culinary*, /api/v1/admin/culinary-contributions,
  /api/v1/admin/culinary-claims, /api/v1/admin/culinary-reports.
  Dua dimensi status TERPISAH: publish_status (draft/published/archived/
  restricted) dan operational_status (unknown/open/temporarily_closed/
  permanently_closed). Approve kind=place_operational tidak mengubah
  publish_status.
  Atribusi gambar WAJIB (name + license) - disimpan verbatim, ikut tampil.
  URL kontak disimpan BERSIH (tanpa UTM); UTM disisip saat render
  (rule external-link-utm).
}
